[# mermaid_flowchart.j2 — skeleton for an inline mermaid block.

   As of v0.2.0, write-pr does NOT ship a `mermaid` filter — Mermaid sources are
   rarely worth saving as separate `.mmd` evidence files. Author the
   fenced mermaid block INLINE in your template (or copy this skeleton).

   GitHub renders mermaid fences natively inside PR bodies AND release notes.

   Variables expected in scope: none (pure-markdown skeleton; edit inline).

   Common shapes:
     - flowchart LR / TD  — request flow, data pipeline
     - sequenceDiagram    — auth handshake, RPC call chain
     - stateDiagram-v2    — state machine
#]

